        "bodyHtml": "Kayle fires a celestial sword that stops on the first enemy hit, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (50% Ability Power) + (60% bonus Attack Damage)) magic damage</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 25/30/35/40/45% for 2 seconds, and removing <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">15% Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span> for 4 seconds from the target and enemies behind them.",
